## Ignore Visual Studio cache and system files
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

## Ignore build outputs
bin/
obj/

## Ignore packages
packages/
*.nupkg

## Ignore logs
*.log

## Ignore user-specific files
*.userprefs

## Ignore publish artifacts (puede incluir appsettings.Production.json con credenciales)
artifacts/
publish/
*.pubxml
*.publishproj

## Ignore backup files
*_backup*/

## Config API: cadena de conexión local (usar appsettings.Development.json.example)
SigmabotConfig.Api/appsettings.Development.json

## Consola: connection string local (usar settings.json.example)
SigmabotSync.Console/settings.json
settings.json
